":{"ru":"Творить поверх себя означает готовность к собственной гибели.","en":"Creating beyond oneself means readiness for one’s own perishing."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced","tos.text-unit.sid-e98b4c403feddecdf7b8c80e32ccdced"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["wheel","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Рождение ребёнка поручено как создание нового созидателя.","en":"Having a child is assigned as creating a new creator."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a905871a1254a0f936a347575bb039af","tos.text-unit.sid-a905871a1254a0f936a347575bb039af"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6e78e324597d3ea67384aed90d0e514f","tos.text-unit.sid-6e78e324597d3ea67384aed90d0e514f"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Горечь любви превращается в жажду творца и тоску по сверхчеловеку.","en":"Love’s bitterness becomes the creator’s thirst and longing for the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b2a2feff62a2c60e09457433461189cf","tos.text-unit.sid-b2a2feff62a2c60e09457433461189cf"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Брак спрашивается через волю к творцу и будущему сверхчеловеку.","en":"Marriage is questioned through willing the creator and future overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c93be184a744c1c889226a2ddeef9c45","tos.text-unit.sid-c93be184a744c1c889226a2ddeef9c45"]},"form":"Schöpfer","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Телесная радость делает дух творцом и благодетелем.","en":"Bodily joy makes spirit a creator and benefactor."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fa168dba1d8904eac5160fec5bf0dbbe","tos.text-unit.sid-fa168dba1d8904eac5160fec5bf0dbbe"]},"form":"Schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","earth","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Созидателям поручено заново положить ценности вещей.","en":"Creators are charged with setting things’ values anew."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2c0d449a18e458f4c2126d6da34b1ce2","tos.text-unit.sid-2c0d449a18e458f4c2126d6da34b1ce2"]},"form":"Unerschöpft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["earth","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-38b348dd12366a8337808dfed204a969","tos.text-unit.sid-38b348dd12366a8337808dfed204a969"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","identity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2a9d12552e21d7aa8cbb46bf849cf165","tos.text-unit.sid-2a9d12552e21d7aa8cbb46bf849cf165"]},"form":"schaffender","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["courage","will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель ограничивает догадку творческой волей слушателя.","en":"The teacher bounds conjecture by the listener’s creative will."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6cb7915a7b167f31ab6190f48c47b800","tos.text-unit.sid-6cb7915a7b167f31ab6190f48c47b800"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вопрос о создании Бога переводится в задачу создания сверхчеловека.","en":"The question of creating God becomes the task of creating the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ff00df1df88a0e09f942944d9214a5d1","tos.text-unit.sid-ff00df1df88a0e09f942944d9214a5d1"]},"form":"umschaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["overman","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Слушатели могут преобразить себя в предков сверхчеловека.","en":"The listeners can transform themselves into the overman’s ancestors."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5c28fc26dac0adc962b474a1ef0fa873","tos.text-unit.sid-5c28fc26dac0adc962b474a1ef0fa873"]},"form":"geschaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","identity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-981af960d1bdf16da0e3eb48454a1005","tos.text-unit.sid-981af960d1bdf16da0e3eb48454a1005"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["courage","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, выдержит ли творец тяжесть догадки о Боге.","en":"The teacher asks whether the creator can bear conjecturing God."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dd4549d204c95af0458c76a477cfa443","tos.text-unit.sid-dd4549d204c95af0458c76a477cfa443"]},"form":"Schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","necessity","agency","redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творение облегчает жизнь через боль и превращение.","en":"Creation lightens life through pain and transformation."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b598d0c42acbbba2285ff06b8cc555b8","tos.text-unit.sid-b598d0c42acbbba2285ff06b8cc555b8"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["affirmation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творцы оправдывают преходящее собственными смертями.","en":"Creators justify transience through their own deaths."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8633a4e29cd08c654ad688a5aef20edc","tos.text-unit.sid-8633a4e29cd08c654ad688a5aef20edc"]},"form":"Schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","will","becoming","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творец становится ребёнком собственного рождения и роженицей.","en":"The creator becomes both the child of their own birth and the mother in labour."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-689b101d0eb2f848e7aaeddf6afe12fc","tos.text-unit.sid-689b101d0eb2f848e7aaeddf6afe12fc"]},"form":"schaffender","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творческая воля сама хочет именно этой судьбы.","en":"Creative will itself desires precisely this fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-100d1ce0ea4374584be917f46d6dea94","tos.text-unit.sid-100d1ce0ea4374584be917f46d6dea94"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Усталость получает облик прекращения воли, оценки и творчества.","en":"Weariness takes the form of ceasing to will, value and create."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9ca655db61f01860d8d127b4987a54a8","tos.text-unit.sid-9ca655db61f01860d8d127b4987a54a8"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9be266f1a7def2f552812d5149265cb0","tos.text-unit.sid-9be266f1a7def2f552812d5149265cb0"]},"form":"Schaffens","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творческая воля возвращает учителя к человеку как молот к камню.","en":"Creative will returns the teacher to the human as a hammer to stone."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2b27fdf43454690c186366aeb6c9129f","tos.text-unit.sid-2b27fdf43454690c186366aeb6c9129f"]},"form":"abschaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fe959c0f966ea242335efe53f13d134c","tos.text-unit.sid-fe959c0f966ea242335efe53f13d134c"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d77b2143ac355db96a401d1366dbac30","tos.text-unit.sid-d77b2143ac355db96a401d1366dbac30"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2e70c0417788cd9ae6a9d2d112a7670a","tos.text-unit.sid-2e70c0417788cd9ae6a9d2d112a7670a"]},"form":"Schaffenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cbfe0291ff20a4b1bf0933da47ea9529","tos.text-unit.sid-cbfe0291ff20a4b1bf0933da47ea9529"]},"form":"schuf","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Покаянные пещеры спрашиваются как убежища от чистого неба.","en":"Penitential caves are questioned as refuges from the clear sky."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f608c1e41b9c21b36c18d056d92a0a10","tos.text-unit.sid-f608c1e41b9c21b36c18d056d92a0a10"]},"form":"Schuf","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","nausea","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение создаёт крылья для нового источника радости.","en":"Disgust creates wings toward a new spring of joy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e6b457c7779c91c9835b72d6a12b10e2","tos.text-unit.sid-e6b457c7779c91c9835b72d6a12b10e2"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2162d72d0033cdd298687969948e4e33","tos.text-unit.sid-2162d72d0033cdd298687969948e4e33"]},"form":"schafft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-377922b29b183ab22e900662f6cc9d33","tos.text-unit.sid-377922b29b183ab22e900662f6cc9d33"]},"form":"Schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e428afe42de2477d0acfc02374a03a57","tos.text-unit.sid-e428afe42de2477d0acfc02374a03a57"]},"form":"unerschöpfte","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will-to-power","will","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Порождающая воля к власти угрожает готовым добру и злу.","en":"Generative will to power threatens established good and evil."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-97b4878b50431cf4b3a65d8eac94d345","tos.text-unit.sid-97b4878b50431cf4b3a65d8eac94d345"]},"form":"schaffe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra","life"],"line":{"ru":"Жизнь становится противницей собственных любимых творений.","en":"Life becomes the opponent of its beloved creations."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a65b9f7040c5267cb25874b562211865","tos.text-unit.sid-a65b9f7040c5267cb25874b562211865"]},"form":"Schöpfer","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["tablets-values","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-875b3371d40c399a43a99d8b23a168bb","tos.text-unit.sid-875b3371d40c399a43a99d8b23a168bb"]},"form":"schöpferische","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-37482b86e24176cfd3227a703a3b2f80","tos.text-unit.sid-37482b86e24176cfd3227a703a3b2f80"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-98c8f181ed7a37e8406f2f3d759c7261","tos.text-unit.sid-98c8f181ed7a37e8406f2f3d759c7261"]},"form":"Schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","earth","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ac66b7d57fcf56c46931688363c9cb22","tos.text-unit.sid-ac66b7d57fcf56c46931688363c9cb22"]},"form":"schaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","will","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Невинность раскрывается волей рождать и творить поверх себя.","en":"Innocence unfolds as willing to beget and create beyond oneself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-039ca52037e007f2e41a6a58f2be366b","tos.text-unit.sid-039ca52037e007f2e41a6a58f2be366b"]},"form":"Schöpfer","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","earth","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь солнца к земле названа невинной творческой страстью.","en":"The sun’s love for earth is named innocent creative desire."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e70ca8f06b5cdd48da728e9d61c3d6ce","tos.text-unit.sid-e70ca8f06b5cdd48da728e9d61c3d6ce"]},"form":"Schaffender","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","identity","rope-bridge","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5d7585f48e3c3ff7eef88bb204463cc3","tos.text-unit.sid-5d7585f48e3c3ff7eef88bb204463cc3"]},"form":"umzuschaffen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","will","counterfactual","redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Искупление превращает «так было» в «так хотел я».","en":"Redemption transforms “it was” into “thus I willed it.”"}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-992df47a90ea6b8344d342589d5f915b","tos.text-unit.sid-992df47a90ea6b8344d342589d5f915b"]},"form":"Schaffender","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель отвечает учением о созидающей воле.","en":"The teacher answers with the teaching of creative will."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cad70ec5a95e4aa4ebec565f3f3a9d3b","tos.text-unit.sid-cad70ec5a95e4aa4ebec565f3f3a9d3b"]},"form":"schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","will","counterfactual","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творческая воля отвечает прошлому собственным желанием.","en":"Creative will answers the past with its own willing."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ff240a868709abef0da385e34299d2c3","tos.text-unit.sid-ff240a868709abef0da385e34299d2c3"]},"form":"schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Желание совершившегося связывает прошлое, настоящее и будущее.","en":"Willing what has happened joins past, present and future."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9a569797e78bce3b2eb90bc6e1383092","tos.text-unit.sid-9a569797e78bce3b2eb90bc6e1383092"]},"form":"Schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творец должен сам создать детей своей надежды.","en":"The creator must make the children of their hope."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ee71950249e0a953d508eb23e1f37d83","tos.text-unit.sid-ee71950249e0a953d508eb23e1f37d83"]},"form":"Mitschaffender","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","tablets-values","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9c9b9c79df8160e5407fe3651fd59ba4","tos.text-unit.sid-9c9b9c79df8160e5407fe3651fd59ba4"]},"form":"schafft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","spirit-of-gravity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-710952c41d23923e1317605e9bb5219c","tos.text-unit.sid-710952c41d23923e1317605e9bb5219c"]},"form":"schafft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","identity","spirit-of-gravity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8bb40557c570531794749735b445764d","tos.text-unit.sid-8bb40557c570531794749735b445764d"]},"form":"schafft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","spirit-of-gravity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5037d67eebfe91bd260d32e4a7ca6eef","tos.text-unit.sid-5037d67eebfe91bd260d32e4a7ca6eef"]},"form":"Schaffende","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-99cf74178c8b92b3103172ebef042328","tos.text-unit.sid-99cf74178c8b92b3103172ebef042328"]},"form":"schafft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["earth","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-